# Build context = repo root (infra/compose.yaml builds apps/web and apps/engine from here).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
# The app template ships its own example env files (they are part of every new project).
!templates/**/.env*.example
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
docs
**/*.log
